     1,
     "<u></u>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" vlink=\"purple\" link=\"blue\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" align=\"left\"><span><font face=\"Arial\" color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"2\">Dear Joe,</font></span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" align=\"left\"><span><font face=\"Arial\" color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"2\"></font></span> </div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" align=\"left\"><span><font face=\"Arial\" color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"2\">Reformat your data. That will make things much easier. Here \r\nis an example with a good structure but with dummy data.</font></span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" align=\"left\"><span><font face=\"Arial\" color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"2\"></font></span> </div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" align=\"left\"><span><font size=\"3\">\r\n<p align=\"left\">ed.data <b>&lt;-</b> expand.grid(Proficiency.Level = </p></font><font color=\"#00007f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#00007f\" size=\"3\">1</font></font><font color=\"#9f3f7f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#9f3f7f\" size=\"3\">:</font></font><font color=\"#00007f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#00007f\" size=\"3\">4</font></font><font size=\"3\">, \r\nSubject = c(</font><font color=\"#3f3faf\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#3f3faf\" size=\"3\">&quot;math&quot;</font></font><font size=\"3\">, </font><font color=\"#3f3faf\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#3f3faf\" size=\"3\">&quot;reading&quot;</font></font><font size=\"3\">), type = \r\nc(</font><font color=\"#3f3faf\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#3f3faf\" size=\"3\">&quot;504.0&quot;</font></font><font size=\"3\">, </font><font color=\"#3f3faf\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#3f3faf\" size=\"3\">&quot;504.1&quot;</font></font><font size=\"3\">, \r\n</font><font color=\"#3f3faf\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#3f3faf\" size=\"3\">&quot;sped&quot;</font></font><font size=\"3\">))\r\n<p align=\"left\">ed.data</p></font><font color=\"#3f5f5f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#3f5f5f\" size=\"3\">$</font></font><font size=\"3\">pointestimate <b>&lt;-</b> \r\nrnorm(nrow(ed.data)) </font><font color=\"#9f3f7f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#9f3f7f\" size=\"3\">+</font></font><font size=\"3\"> ed.data</font><font color=\"#3f5f5f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#3f5f5f\" size=\"3\">$</font></font><font size=\"3\">Proficiency.Level\r\n<p align=\"left\">ed.data</p></font><font color=\"#3f5f5f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#3f5f5f\" size=\"3\">$</font></font><font size=\"3\">LCL <b>&lt;-</b> ed.data</font><font color=\"#3f5f5f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#3f5f5f\" size=\"3\">$</font></font><font size=\"3\">pointestimate </font><font color=\"#9f3f7f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#9f3f7f\" size=\"3\">-</font></font><font size=\"3\"> </font><font color=\"#00007f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#00007f\" size=\"3\">1.96</font></font><font size=\"3\">\r\n<p align=\"left\">ed.data</p></font><font color=\"#3f5f5f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#3f5f5f\" size=\"3\">$</font></font><font size=\"3\">UCL <b>&lt;-</b> ed.data</font><font color=\"#3f5f5f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#3f5f5f\" size=\"3\">$</font></font><font size=\"3\">pointestimate </font><font color=\"#9f3f7f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#9f3f7f\" size=\"3\">+</font></font><font size=\"3\"> </font><font color=\"#00007f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#00007f\" size=\"3\">1.96</font></font><font size=\"3\">\r\n<p align=\"left\"></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\">ggplot(subset(ed.data, type </p></font><font color=\"#9f3f7f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#9f3f7f\" size=\"3\">==</font></font><font size=\"3\"> </font><font color=\"#3f3faf\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#3f3faf\" size=\"3\">&quot;sped&quot;</font></font><font size=\"3\">), aes(x = Proficiency.Level, y = pointestimate, ymin = LCL, ymax = UCL, \r\ncolour = Subject)) </font><font color=\"#9f3f7f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#9f3f7f\" size=\"3\">+</font></font><font size=\"3\"> geom_ribbon(fill=</font><font color=\"#3f3faf\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#3f3faf\" size=\"3\">&quot;gray&quot;</font></font><font size=\"3\">,alpha=</font><font color=\"#00007f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#00007f\" size=\"3\">.25</font></font><font size=\"3\">,lwd=</font><font color=\"#00007f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#00007f\" size=\"3\">.5</font></font><font size=\"3\">) </font><font color=\"#9f3f7f\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#9f3f7f\" size=\"3\">+</font></font><font size=\"3\"> \r\ngeom_point()</font>\r\n<p align=\"left\"><font size=\"3\"></font> </p>\r\n<p align=\"left\"><font size=\"3\"><span><font face=\"Arial\" color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"2\">HTH,</font></span></font></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\"><font size=\"3\"><span><font face=\"Arial\" color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"2\">Thierry</font></span></font></p></span></div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n<p><font size=\"2\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------<br>ir. \r\nThierry Onkelinx<br>Instituut voor natuur- en bosonderzoek<br>team Biometrie \r\n&amp; Kwaliteitszorg<br>Gaverstraat 4<br>9500 \r\nGeraardsbergen<br>Belgium<br><br>Research Institute for Nature and \r\nForest<br>team Biometrics &amp; Quality Assurance<br>Gaverstraat 4<br>9500 \r\nGeraardsbergen<br>Belgium<br><br>tel. + 32 54/436 \r\n185<br><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Thierry....@inbo.be</a><br><a href=\"http://www.inbo.be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.inbo.be&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792384867244000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Z_Uu4eAzWBL9BOXcPOQhr\">www.inbo.be</a><br><br>To call in the \r\nstatistician after the experiment is done may be no more than asking him to \r\nperform a post-mortem examination: he may be able to say what the experiment \r\ndied of.<br>~ Sir Ronald Aylmer Fisher<br><br>The plural of anecdote is not \r\ndata.<br>~ Roger Brinner<br><br>The combination of some data and an aching \r\ndesire for an answer does not ensure that a reasonable answer can be extracted \r\nfrom a given body of data.<br>~ John Tukey<br> </font> </p>\r\n<div> </div><br>\r\n<div lang=\"nl\" dir=\"ltr\" align=\"left\">\r\n<hr>\r\n<font face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><b>Van:</b> Joe King [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">j...@joepking.com</a>] \r\n<br><b>Verzonden:</b> vrijdag 27 november 2009 7:52<br><b>Aan:</b> \r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br><b>Onderwerp:</b> plotting \r\nerror<br></font><br></div></div>"
