     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" vlink=\"purple\" link=\"blue\">\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:12pt;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,&#39;serif&#39;\">Hi all I am \r\ntrying to make a plot with lines and confidence intervals, this is the code I \r\nhave so far, along with my dput and session info. I am sorry for the deluge of \r\ndata but I am working on this and trying to get the code \r\nright.:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:12pt;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,&#39;serif&#39;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:12pt;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,&#39;serif&#39;\">plot1&lt;-ggplot(melt(ed.data))<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:12pt;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,&#39;serif&#39;\">plot1&lt;-plot1+geom_point(aes(Proficiency.Level,pointestimates.reading.sped.1,colour=&quot;red&quot;)+geom_line(colour=&quot;red&quot;))<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:12pt;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,&#39;serif&#39;\">plot1&lt;-plot1+geom_point(aes(Proficiency.Level,pointestimates.math.sped.1,colour=&quot;blue&quot;)+geom_line(colour=&quot;blue&quot;))<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:12pt;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,&#39;serif&#39;\">plot1&lt;-plot1+geom_ribbon(aes(ymin=cilower.math.sped.1,ymax=ciupper.math.sped.1,colour=&quot;red&quot;,fill=&quot;gray&quot;,alpha=.25,lwd=.5))<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:12pt;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,&#39;serif&#39;\">plot1&lt;-plot1+geom_ribbon(aes(ymin=cilower.reading.sped.1,ymax=ciupper.reading.sped.1,colour=&quot;blue&quot;,fill=&quot;gray&quot;,alpha=.25,lwd=.5))<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:12pt;FONT-FAMILY:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,&#39;serif&#39;